            "review_title": "Review at Lamuno Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Danny G\nChiang Mai, Chiang Mai, Thailand6 contributions\n0\nNew Restaurant in Nice Hotel!\nAug 2018 • Couples\nWe were staying at the lamuno hotel and were too tired to go out so we ate at the restaurant in the lobby and found out it had just opened and we were one of the first customers! They had very delicious affordable food with mostly vietnamese foods and some fusion/western dishes.\n\nBig portions and good flavors and great service! Definitely recommended.\n\nUnfortunately I was so hungry started eating before taking pictures, but we had a seafood fried rice, chicken and cashew nut, and a spicy pork vietnamse noodle soup that they customize to our preferences.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 26, 2018",
